  {
   "name": "places/ChIJFdq6qaZGiEgR_6iXeJty8Ks/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KUFVITm1XVkJKUzNwSVRHWnlVMDlXZWxoWU5YYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "I’ve been coming here regularly for highlights and always have such a great experience. Everyone at the salon is so welcoming and friendly, and Louise is absolutely amazing. She really listens to what I want and consistently gets my hair exactly right every time. I always leave feeling so happy and confident with my hair. Highly recommend both Louise and the salon!",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
