  {
   "name": "places/ChIJFdq6qaZGiEgR_6iXeJty8Ks/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWdlRtRklNVFl4YTNkNlYxVkJNR2w0U2sxcmMyYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "It’s always such a pleasure coming to Hair in the City, but tonight was the first time I had the privilege of a restyle by Louise. I had a particular style in mind, and she absolutely nailed it. Louise is a truly talented stylist, so welcoming and friendly, and together with the rest of the team she creates such a lovely atmosphere in the salon.\nI left the salon absolutely loving my hair. I couldn’t recommend Hair in the City more highly 😊",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
